    "innovation": "Using a novel hierarchical modeling approach that links regional cloud-resolving simulations with a global climate model, this paper demonstrates that Asian pollution has significantly invigorated mid-latitude cyclones over the Pacific, reconciling model results with three decades of observational data.",
